'' 'space( n )' AND 'string( n, c )' ARE NARROW, so a 'wstring ptr' parameter gets them widened.
'' The wide operand path took fb_SPACE's and fb_StrFill's descriptors as UTF-16 text -- len 3,
'' asc 27936 for 'space( 3 )' (FINDINGS 5.10). Output measured with fbc-modern 1.20.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/mir/src/wide-ptr-space-run.bas -o tests/mir/wideptrspacerun.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/mir/wideptrspacerun.exe
'' RUN: tests/mir/wideptrspacerun.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 5 120 120
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 4 65 65
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 3 32 32
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 3 108 116
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 2 121 121
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 2 119 119
